{"id":"59f9df438acba46e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative.md","title":"Quantitative Cut Elimination","display":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative","aliases":["72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative"],"display":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination","depends_on":[],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local conditional derivation; background Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"补出最坏情形界对输入长度和切度阈值的单调性"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local conditional derivation; background Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出最坏情形界对输入长度和切度阈值的单调性"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是可判定的合法输入证明编码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是无切输出编码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q\">\\(c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q\\)</span> 为结论函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:E\\to\\omega\">\\(d:E\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是总可计算的切度函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0\\)</span> 是总可计算函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))\">\\(\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\rho|\">\\(|\\rho|\\)</span> 始终表示二进制编码长度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}\">\\(F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\omega\">\\(n&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\omega\\)</span>；两个阈值仍针对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,d,\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(E,d,\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>，不在比较时改变编码或算法。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d(\\pi))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d(\\pi))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\le n&#39;\\land k\\le k&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n&#39;,k&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\le n&#39;\\land k\\le k&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n&#39;,k&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地条件性推导，背景为第 I 章 §2.4，印刷 pp.36–42 / PDF pp.48–54。长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制串有限；逐个判定是否属于 E，再对满足切度界的串运行已假定总的 CE，即可计算显示的最大值。输入 π 自身属于该有限集合，故不等式成立。</p>\n<p>这证明的是已给出总切消算法时存在可计算最坏情形界；它没有构造或证明 CE 的终止，也不是原书 Theorem 2.4.2 的具体塔式界。旧式混淆了节点数与编码长度，并含损坏的 operatorname 宏；二者均已修订。</p>\n<p>阈值增加只扩大取最大值的有限候选集合，故新单调性式成立。此处仍是参数固定的算法最坏界，不将它改称原书的具体塔式消切界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"d:E\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))","display":false},{"tex":"|\\rho|","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}","display":false},{"tex":"n',k'\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E,d,\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d(\\pi))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"n\\le n'\\land k\\le k'\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d,\\mathrm{CE}}(n',k').","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2428,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative|thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination](72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative|thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative]]"}],"outgoing":[]}